---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cost Breakdown & Rate Calculation | Valorferrum"
  description="Transparent rate calculation for freelancer services. Understandable cost structure without hidden surcharges."
  lang="en"
>
  <!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-primary/8 rounded-full blur-[120px] pulse-anim"></div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <div class="reveal mb-4">
        <a href="/en/pricing/" class="text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 group">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:-translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back to pricing
        </a>
      </div>

      <h1 class="reveal font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 leading-tight" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        How the hourly rate is calculated
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal text-text-secondary text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
        €110/hour is not made up. It is based on a dedicated calculation
        of real costs and a quality & risk buffer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== BREAKDOWN ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6" aria-labelledby="breakdown-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border text-center">
          <div class="text-5xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-3">€92</div>
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2 text-lg">Cost Coverage</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Real costs and taxes. Everything needed to work sustainably
            – without excess profit, without bloated structure.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border text-center" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-5xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-3">€18</div>
          <h3 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-2 text-lg">Quality & Risk Buffer</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            All-in-one competence without juniors. You pay for experience that is
            directly deployable – and for the security that fixed prices stay fixed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6">Cost structure in detail</h3>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-sm">
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-3">Personal costs (€3,250/month)</h4>
            <ul class="text-text-secondary space-y-2">
              <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Living expenses</span><span>€2,300</span></li>
              <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Retirement savings</span><span>€650</span></li>
              <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Buffer / emergency fund</span><span>€200</span></li>
              <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Continued education</span><span>€100</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-3">Business fixed costs (€2,095/month)</h4>
            <ul class="text-text-secondary space-y-2">
              <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Health insurance (voluntary)</span><span>€1,050</span></li>
              <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Pension insurance</span><span>€600</span></li>
              <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Software & tools</span><span>€200</span></li>
              <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Disability, liability, etc.</span><span>€245</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-border">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-text-primary font-semibold">
            <span>Total costs per year</span>
            <span>€64,140</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-2">
            At 1,014 billable hours/year (35h/week, 46 weeks, 70% utilisation)
            this results in a cost coverage rate of €92/hour.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== WORK CAPACITY ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface" aria-labelledby="capacity-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 id="capacity-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Work capacity & calculation basis
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          The hourly rate is determined not only by costs, but also by
          realistically achievable working time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-2">1,610 h</div>
          <div class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Theoretical annual capacity<br>(35h × 46 weeks)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border text-center" style="transition-delay: 50ms;">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-2">1,449 h</div>
          <div class="text-text-secondary text-sm">– 10% non-billable<br>(admin, acquisition)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border text-center" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-2">1,014 h</div>
          <div class="text-text-secondary text-sm">× 70% realistic utilisation<br>= billable hours</div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border text-center" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary mb-2">€92/h</div>
          <div class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Cost coverage rate<br>(€64,140 ÷ 1,014 h)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border">
        <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-text-primary">Why 70% utilisation?</strong> As a freelancer without a sales team
          and with direct client support, 100% utilisation over the year is not realistic.
          The 70% accounts for illness, holiday, acquisition, administration and strategic development.
          Anyone promising you 100% is lying – or secretly outsourcing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== CTA ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/15 via-spectrum-pink/10 to-spectrum-blue/15"></div>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <p class="reveal text-lg text-text-secondary mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Still have questions about the calculation? I am happy to explain every item in an initial consultation.
      </p>
      <div class="reveal flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="px-8 py-4 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-primary/25 hover:shadow-primary/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0">
          Free Initial Consultation
        </a>
        <a href="/en/pricing/" class="px-8 py-4 border border-primary/30 hover:border-primary text-primary hover:text-primary-light rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-primary/5">
          Back to packages
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>